{"corpus":"ccc","number":441,"text_html":"<span> <i class=\"typo_italic\">Fils de Dieu</i>, dans l’Ancien Testament, est un titre donné aux anges <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>, au peuple de l’Élection <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">2</sup>, aux enfants d’Israël <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">3</sup> et à leurs rois <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"10\">4</sup>. Il signifie alors une filiation adoptive qui établit entre Dieu et sa créature des relations d’une intimité particulière. Quand le Roi-Messie promis est dit « fils de Dieu » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"12\">5</sup>, cela n’implique pas nécessairement, selon le sens littéral de ces textes, qu’il soit plus qu’humain. Ceux qui ont désigné ainsi Jésus en tant que Messie d’Israël <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"14\">6</sup> n’ont peut-être pas voulu dire davantage <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"15\">7</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":[],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Dt 32:8"},{"text":"Jb 1:6"},{"text":"Ex 4:22"},{"text":"Os 11:1"},{"text":"Jr 3:19"},{"text":"Si 36:11"},{"text":"Sg 18:13"},{"text":"Dt 14:1"},{"text":"Os 2:1"},{"text":"Os 2 S 7:14"},{"text":"Ps 82:6"},{"text":"1 Ch 17:13"},{"text":"Ps 2:7"},{"text":"Mt 27:54"},{"text":"Lc 23:47"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Dt 32:8","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Jb 1:6","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ex 4:22","idx":3,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Os 11:1","idx":4,"marker_idx":3,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Jr 3:19","idx":5,"marker_idx":3,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Si 36:11","idx":6,"marker_idx":3,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Sg 18:13","idx":7,"marker_idx":3,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Dt 14:1","idx":8,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Os 2:1","idx":9,"marker_idx":8,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir 2 S 7:14","idx":10,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ps 82:6","idx":11,"marker_idx":10,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir 1 Ch 17:13","idx":12,"display_idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ps 2:7","idx":13,"marker_idx":12,"display_idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 27:54","idx":14,"display_idx":6},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Lc 23:47","idx":15,"display_idx":7}]}